:"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qDf41"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3B097BCD-EE57-4FA4-ABC1-91749009F967","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"エディタを使わない方が最高年収高そう","ts":"1624685218.313000","edited":{"user":"U022TD5GGKE","ts":"1624685240.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A495D96F-9568-4424-889F-1A51C53BD6BA","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"VSCodeとvimの平均年齢が多分乖離しているので","ts":"1624681019.312000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6NQD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FDB0B91A-3BD4-47A3-BCFE-9FA3775A8527","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ前も話題になってたけど平均年齢との相関を出すべき","ts":"1624680992.311300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/E2oS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"029ad6f6-dcd8-4a92-b2f1-4c0a86b1beda","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"SESだけど今までVisual Studio Codeをプロジェクトでの\n基本テキストエディタで採用してたところ1箇所しか遭遇しなかった・・・","ts":"1624680972.310600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"evM=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e9aeb0d-25f6-464e-844f-fa739fb432ce","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"無料でMSから出てるって点で\nサクラエディタと秀丸しか知らん化石企業が採用すると思ってたんだけどそうでもなかったな","ts":"1624680872.309200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIBOb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5153002a-b72b-4cc1-8001-a1da9dc3bcc0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"出た当時から強くなるのは予想ついてはいたんだけど\nシェア上がるの遅い","ts":"1624680801.308000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6R6M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4019cd0e-c18f-4448-bf92-3702156918e1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"少なくとも 800 万円台〜の母数は少なめだと思います。\n800万円台の回答者数は24の倍数、900万円台は8の倍数、1000万円台は6の倍数ということが帯の長さから分かりますが、\nまあ、おそらく順に24人、8人、6人なんでしょうね。（900万円台は16人という可能性もあるかも。偶然全カラムが2の倍数だったパターンです。）\n24人位入れば傾向はある程度見えるんでしょうが、さすがに8人や6人だけ見て傾向は読み取れません。","ts":"1624680721.306500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R4/z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fe412d1-ff03-4b85-bf7d-1b71519640f8","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"Visual Studio Code、強くなったなぁ","ts":"1624680675.305500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lxF0/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9a7f2c9-18b3-44b5-85fe-59657bdb02fa","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"何人にアンケート取ったのかも謎だもんな","ts":"1624680533.303100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YEjL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa01cae3-1094-4d68-912e-33b3b2b1d7cc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"積み上げ棒グラフ、100%積み上げにすると母数が見えなくなるので、あえてそれを選んでいるということは。。？ということですかね。","ts":"1624680392.302500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"236V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1235d4e-c297-431c-8c8b-f33ca5aa80b1","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"某プログラミングスクールだとVim必修だけどwwwwww","ts":"1624680280.301600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fkM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13db1ddb-9a55-4836-b68f-ce1f3ab0dbf7","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"私もこれから始める人に何がいいか聞かれたら\nサクラエディタかVisual StudioCodeだな","ts":"1624680190.300900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ASDGy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ee07177-53dc-4a74-8728-e5b753686b36","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"つまり、1000万台で Vi が消えてるのは偶然だと思います。（単に6人のなかに Vi 使いがいなかった）","ts":"1624680172.300400","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1624680189.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N99Eh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"029e84e7-ae12-4265-a7e9-adebb63c1509","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"笑 なるほど","ts":"1624680170.300300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z5zp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8db4a600-599b-40a4-942e-710b69c2fe72","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あと、これは根拠ないですが、「1000 万台」の回答者数、6人とかなんじゃないかなって気がします。そうすると帯の長さがぴったり合うので。","ts":"1624680143.299500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c03"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bb364eb-4d7f-436c-bd6a-cc1266b28867","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"こういうの見ると、まあ十中八九「年齢」という要素が背景にある疑似相関なんだろうな、という気になりますね…\n若者は VSCode を使いがち、ということなんじゃないかなと","ts":"1624680057.297800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1624680067.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U77E0CBHQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XIQ9v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef96816b-8dfb-40bf-99c5-93e94e901a7d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"1000万台でVi勢が消えてるのもポイント?ですかね。素Vi勢が消滅してしまった。。","ts":"1624679959.296900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eKy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dca712d8-0383-4f72-90fd-3db15d2d8dfc","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"どこに生息してるかわからない所がすごい","ts":"1624679862.296300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eUx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75e524cd-489e-41